description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & 30% DEF/RES Pierce to Dark Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if the user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Dark;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Dark Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [During Tactical Awoken Mode, Instant Dark & chases Dark abilities with 20 single-target Dark/NE physical attacks, Dark Ability Damage +50% for 1 turn to user (max 2 chases)] to user

